description:
Provision for a Linen &amp; Laundry managed Service to West Suffolk NHS Foundation Trust (WSH) to deliver the following:
a)	Provision of Clean Linen to point of use;
b)	Provision of clean uniforms to Authority Staff;
c)	Collection and processing of Used Linen;
d)	Repairs and alterations to Linen; 
e)	Provision of return to sender laundering service;
f)	Provision of Clean Theatre Linen;
g)	Provision of IT based monitoring systems / RFID tagging for stock control of RTS items;
h)	Provision of reusable surgical packs including drapes and gowns
